# Local leaderboard database when running the server outside the VPS. In production
# the data lives in /var/lib/irontide-leaderboard, deliberately outside the checkout —
# the deploy path is `git reset --hard` and would take the database with it.
server-leaderboard/.data/

# Promotion assets and build artifacts. Not in version control — regenerate with
# tools/. In each worktree, promo/ is a symlink to a single shared directory beside
# the checkouts, so a tool run from any worktree lands its output in the same place
# (and matches the paths the launch kits cite).
/promo
promo/builds/
promo/assets/
tools/trailer/frames/
tools/trailer/out/
